# J12 · the crawler. On a real install of toml_pin with the packages its lock
# pins: from the Library, every target the reader publishes is hovered (a
# card that rises must come quickly, stay in the window and off its
# trigger, and go when the pointer leaves), clicked (the page it opens draws:
# no fault plate, no empty reader, no lint), and left by ⌘[ (the route comes
# back with the keyboard on what was clicked), two pages deep; then again at
# a big screen, a narrow window and two phones, in both themes.
size 1440x900
start from install-all frontends/rust/fixtures/toml_pin

check library
  route like "orbit"
  ground dark in reader

crawl 2 per 8

resize 2560x1440
crawl 1 per 6

resize 760x900
crawl 1 per 6

resize 390x844
crawl 1 per 5

resize 320x640
crawl 1 per 5

# Glacier, by the person's own hand in Settings.
resize 1440x900
key cmd-,
click "Glacier" in reader
key escape
check glacier
  route like "orbit"
  ground light in reader

crawl 2 per 8

resize 2560x1440
crawl 1 per 6

resize 760x900
crawl 1 per 6

resize 390x844
crawl 1 per 5

resize 320x640
crawl 1 per 5

resize 1440x900
check end
  route like "orbit"
